    66	  `delivered-history` retention, digest-checked re-authorization at reconnect, a
    67	  FIFO outbox settled by OCC, local evaluation by the twin, and asset bytes under
    68	  the owning row's lease. Not built until a brief's number asks (LLP 1012 §11):
